5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I think we need a clear picture of the costs and the actual time spent cleaning. I'll look into the management office rate sheet and billing, and the tin's receipts for the bathroom spray.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to understand the actual time commitment involved. I'll look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we should examine the actual usage patterns and the discrepancies in our standards. I'll look into a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and what each housemate counts as done.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see why things feel so inconsistent! I'll check the rows recorded in the house chat and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we maintain a good atmosphere in the house. I'll look into the absences on the wall calendar and the note left by the previous tenants.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
